splay:inline-block;background:#CF63CF;color:#fff;border-radius:12px;padding:2px 10px;font-weight:700;font-size:13.5px;box-shadow:0 2px 0 rgba(0,0,0,.18)\\"><b>Zafer</b> sesini çal</span> <span style=\\"display:inline-block;background:#9966FF;color:#fff;border-radius:12px;padding:2px 10px;font-weight:700;font-size:13.5px;box-shadow:0 2px 0 rgba(0,0,0,.18)\\"><b>«Süper!»</b> de</span> <span style=\\"display:inline-block;background:#9966FF;color:#fff;border-radius:12px;padding:2px 10px;font-weight:700;font-size:13.5px;box-shadow:0 2px 0 rgba(0,0,0,.18)\\">(birleştir: <b>«Cevap: »</b> ((a) <b>*</b> (b))) de</span>"}},{"type":"paragraph","data":{"text":"<i>Blokların sırasını sen bul! Takılırsan <b>💡 Bilgi Al</b> düğmesi çözümü gösterir (ödül yarıya iner).</i>"}},{"type":"paragraph","data":{"text":"💡 Değişken + rastgele + soru + karşılaştırma: kendi matematik oyununu yaptın!"}},{"type":"paragraph","data":{"text":"📦 Değişkenleri <b>Değişkenler</b> kategorisinde bulursun (<b>a</b>, <b>b</b> hazır)."}}],"version":"2.31.6"},"blueprint":{"ana_cozum":"<xml xmlns=\\"https://developers.google.com/blockly/xml\\"><variables><variable id=\\"v_0cc175b9c0\\">a</variable><variable id=\\"v_92eb5ffee6\\">b</variable></variables><block type=\\"mblock_olay_bayrak_tiklandiginda\\" x=\\"30\\" y=\\"30\\"><next><block type=\\"variables_set\\"><field name=\\"VAR\\" id=\\"v_0cc175b9c0\\">a</field><value name=\\"VALUE\\"><block type=\\"mblock_islem_rastgele\\"><value name=\\"MIN\\"><shadow type=\\"math_number\\"><field name=\\"NUM\\">1</field></shadow></value><value name=\\"MAX\\"><shadow type=\\"math_number\\"><field name=\\"NUM\\">10</field></shadow></value></block></value><next><block type=\\"variables_set\\"><field name=\\"VAR\\" id=\\"v_92eb5ffee6\\">b</field><value name=\\"VALUE\\"><block type=\\"mblock_islem_rastgele\\"><value name=\\"MIN\\"><shadow type=\\"math_number\\"><field name=\\"NUM\\">1</field></shadow></value><value name=\\"MAX\\"><shadow type=\\"math_number\\"><field name=\\"NUM